  "text": "\r\n\t\t Litchfield, NH | Official Website \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\n             EMERGENCY ALERT \n\tFRAUD ALERT – LITCHFIELD PLANNING BOARD & ZONING BOARD OF ADJUSTMENT\r\n\t Read On... \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n\t\t\t Search \n     Government   \t\t\t \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Community   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Permits & Forms \r\n\t\t\t Motor Vehicle \nRegistration \r\n\t\t\t Property Tax Payments \r\n\t\t\t Contact Us \r\n\t\t\t Ordinances \r\nPopular Links \nQuickly Find What You Need \r\n         Resident Request Form \n         Property Taxes Review/Pay Online \n         Estimate Vehicle Registration Cost \n         Recycling Hours \n         Sign-up for Alerts & Notifications \n         Dog Licenses \n         Vital Records \n         Town Newsletters \n         Tax Credit & Exemption Programs \n         Meetings Online \n         Submit Event for Calendar \n         2026 Holiday Schedule \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nNews & Calendar \nStay Connected \r\n\t Public Hearing - Donation  \r\nThe Litchfield Board of Selectmen will hold a public hearing on Monday, October 26th at 6:30 PM at the Town Office Meeting Room, 2 Liberty Way, Litchfield, NH for the purpose of receiving public comment\t\t\t\t Read on... \r\n\t Request for Proposals  \r\nProposal specifications are available at the Litchfield Town Office and Town website\r\n(www.litchfieldnh.gov). Sealed proposals are due, in accordance with the\r\nspecifications, by 4:00 pm on Thursday, November 5, 2026.\t\t\t\t Read on... \r\n\t\t View All News \r\n/CivicAlerts.aspx \r\n\t Town \r\n\t Community \r\n\t Town \r\nOctober 2026 \r\nS\r\nM\r\nT\r\nW\r\nT\r\nF\r\nS\r\n27 \t\t\t\t\r\n 28 \t\t\t\t\r\n 29 \t\t\t\t\r\n 30 \t\t\t\t\r\n  1 \t\t\t\t\r\n  2 \t\t\t\t\r\n  3 \t\t\t\t\r\n 4 \t\t\t\t\r\n  5 \t\t\t\t\r\n  6 \t\t\t\t\r\n  7 \t\t\t\t\r\n  8 \t\t